sequenceDiagram
    participant YAML as rhoai-disconnected-images.yaml<br/>(Image Manifest)
    participant Tooling as Mirroring Tooling<br/>(oc-mirror / skopeo)
    participant Quay as quay.io/modh<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RHIO as registry.redhat.io/rhoai<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Mirror as Disconnected Mirror Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over YAML,Mirror: Disconnected Image Mirroring Flow

    Tooling->>YAML: Read image list<br/>(File read, N/A)
    YAML-->>Tooling: 68 digest-pinned<br/>image references

    Note over Tooling: Parse image refs by category:<br/>Ray, training, notebooks, pipelines

    par Pull upstream images
        Tooling->>Quay: Pull fms-hf-tuning image<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, Registry auth
        Quay-->>Tooling: Image layers (sha256 verified)
        Tooling->>Quay: Pull Ray images (5 variants)<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, Registry auth
        Quay-->>Tooling: Image layers (sha256 verified)
    and Pull productized images
        Tooling->>RHIO: Pull training runtime images<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, Registry auth
        RHIO-->>Tooling: Image layers (sha256 verified)
        Tooling->>RHIO: Pull notebook workbench images<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, Registry auth
        RHIO-->>Tooling: Image layers (sha256 verified)
        Tooling->>RHIO: Pull pipeline runtime images<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, Registry auth
        RHIO-->>Tooling: Image layers (sha256 verified)
    end

    Tooling->>Mirror: Push all mirrored images<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, Registry auth
    Mirror-->>Tooling: Push confirmation

    Note over Mirror: All 68 images available<br/>in disconnected environment
